WEBVTT

00:00:30.818 --> 00:00:32.820
I screamed and ran outside.

00:00:33.654 --> 00:00:36.491
And I still remember
those dirty handprints

00:00:36.491 --> 00:00:39.202
on my white, crisp cotton shirt,

00:00:39.243 --> 00:00:42.038
announcing to the world
what had just happened.

00:00:43.206 --> 00:00:45.249
I returned home devastated,

00:00:45.291 --> 00:00:49.754
kept the lights on all through the night
and the outdoors terrified me.

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:52.381
I didn't want to go out at all.

00:00:53.341 --> 00:00:57.845
It is not news that women
face rampant violence inside homes as well

00:00:57.887 --> 00:00:59.138
across the world.

00:00:59.847 --> 00:01:04.811
So if it's unsafe outside and inside,
where do we go?